# The launcher is a Windows batch script: it MUST have CRLF line endings on every clone,
# independent of core.autocrlf. Without this, a clone with autocrlf=false (or on a non-Windows
# checkout) would get LF and cmd.exe can misbehave on some constructs.
content/launcher/strix.bat text eol=crlf
content/README.md          text eol=crlf
*.ps1                      text eol=crlf
